# Secret material at any depth. The root-only `.env` lines above do not match nested paths, and
# Dockerfile.python copies all of apps/ into its images. Exclusions come before the example
# templates re-included after them.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env*.example
**/.dev.vars*
!**/.dev.vars*.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.netrc
**/.npmrc
# Local tooling and credential-state directories
**/.claude
**/.codex
**/.cursor
**/.wrangler
**/.aws
**/.ssh
